tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/37.html\">Surah As-Saaffaat</a> › Verse 141</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah As-Saaffaat 37:141</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَسَاهَمَ فَكَانَ مِنَ الْمُدْحَضِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And he drew lots and was among the losers.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">يقول تعالى: فقارع، فكان من المغلوبين.<cite>«الطرق الحكمية» 1/245</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s37a141\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/37-130.html\">Previous verse (37:130)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/37-146.html\">Next verse (37:146)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/37-146.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of As-Saaffaat 37:146 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"And We caused to grow over him a gourd vine.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/37-146.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/37-146.html\">\n<link rel=\"alte